abstract: >
  Closed-form Empathy Score E(t) = tanh(αC + βA + γR) · Φ − η
  for fictional and agentic characters in long-form co-authored
  narrative. Intent is out of scope. Standing only.
keywords:
  - empathy score
  - narrative agents
  - long-form LLM
  - character consistency
